content.text:
Need maybe add note about login redirect? no.

Now create cadastro.php. Need full markup. Let's write. Ensure `htmlspecialchars` via h() available. csrf_campo. Validate. Use `perfis_validos()`.

Potential email value on error: preserve. Password not preserve. Good.

Handle duplicate: use try/catch PDOException code 23000. Could check first then insert; race negligible. Use transaction? no.

Need profile descriptions maybe a select plus help.

Also set `autocomplete` attributes. Name, email, new-password.

Need no login required. If logged in, redirect to pagina_inicial.

Code:

```php
<?php
require_once __DIR__ . '/auth.php';

if (usuario_logado()) redirecionar(pagina_inicial());

$erro = '';
$nome = trim((string)($_POST['nome'] ?? ''));
$email = mb_strtolower(trim((string)($_POST['email'] ?? '')));
$tipoAcesso = (string)($_POST['tipo_acesso'] ?? 'Almoxarifado');
$setor = trim(...);
$telefone = trim(...);

if ($_SERVER['REQUEST_METHOD'] === 'POST') {
  if (!csrf_validar()) { $erro=...; }
  else {
    $senha=...; $confirmar=...
    if (mb_strlen($nome)<3) ...
    elseif (!filter_var($email...)) ...
    elseif (!in_array($tipoAcesso, perfis_validos(), true)) ...
    elseif (mb_strlen($senha)<8) ...
    elseif ($senha !== $confirmar) ...
    elseif (mb_strlen($setor)>100 || mb_strlen($telefone)>20) ...
    else {
      global $pdo;
      try {
        $stmt = $pdo->prepare("SELECT COUNT(*) FROM usuarios WHERE email = ?");
        ...
        if count >0 -> $erro
        else insert...
        if success {
          $_SESSION['cadastro_sucesso'] = 'Cadastro realizado! ...';
          $_SESSION['cadastro_email'] = $email;
          redirecionar('index.php?aviso=cadastro');
        }
      } catch (PDOException $e) { error_log; $erro = '...' }
    }
  }
}
```

When PDOException duplicate maybe message. Keep generic but log.

Use `password_hash`.

Metadata title "Criar conta | EpiSafe".

Left brand could be simpler copy specific to cadastro. Reuse features? Use a concise "Crie seu acesso em poucos passos." and list of profiles? Maybe show the same brand features to keep visual consistency. I'll show a "Como funciona" list with 3 items: cadastre, entre, use only pages. Good.

Form card:
```
<header class="login-head">
  badge plus user icon
  <h2>Criar conta</h2>
  <p>Preencha os dados. Seu perfil define quais páginas você poderá acessar.</p>
</header>
<?php if erro ?>...
<form method="POST" action="cadastro.php" class="login-form cadastro-form" autocomplete="off" novalidate>
 csrf
 <div class="form-group"><label>Nome completo</label><div class="input-icon">...<input ...></div></div>
 <div class="form-group"><label>E-mail</label>...</div>
 <div class="form-row">
   <div class="form-group"><label>Perfil de acesso</label><select...></div>
   <div class="form-group"><label>Setor</label><input></div>
 </div>
 <div class="form-group"><label>Telefone</label><input></div>
 <div class="form-row">
   <div class="form-group"><label>Senha</label> input-icon input-senha ...
   <div class="form-group"><label>Confirmar senha</label> ...
 </div>
 <button class="btn-login">Criar conta ...</button>
</form>
<p class="login-foot">Já tem cadastro? <a href="index.php">Entrar no sistema</a></p>
```

For icon inputs, need svg. Could reuse. For select, no icon.

Add JS toggles for `senha` and `senha_confirmar` plus caps warning maybe. Ensure `data-toggle-senha` uses id. Also confirm validation client side? Add small script:
```js
var form = document.querySelector('.cadastro-form');
form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
 var s=..., c=...;
 if (s.value !== c.value) { e.preventDefault(); c.setCustomValidity('As senhas não coincidem.'); c.reportValidity(); } else c.setCustomValidity('');
});
```
But novalidate disables native; custom validity still works if call reportValidity. Could remove novalidate. Better server-side is enough. But nice to have. Add `required minlength=8` for both and no novalidate, browser validation handles. Keep novalidate? index uses novalidate but has required. Not important. I'll omit novalidate on cadastro so browser validates. Then also `minlength`.

Also inline note about password.

Let's write file.

